<details class="group border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 cursor-pointer open:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors shadow-sm"><summary class="font-headline-sm text-primary text-[18px] flex justify-between items-center list-none font-semibold">At what age should wisdom teeth be removed?<span class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform text-secondary">expand_more</span></summary><p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Earlier is usually easier. Roots are not fully formed in the late teens, and bone is softer. Most oral surgeons recommend removal in the late teens to early twenties if needed.</p></details>
